# warehouse-kpi-dashboard currently reads no environment variables -- it runs
# entirely on local files: the dashboard and the notebook read the committed
# synthetic CSVs (data/generate_data.py), and build_db.py loads those same CSVs
# into a local SQLite database (warehouse.db) for sql/queries.sql. Kept as a
# template per the project root interface (nqwrc.dots setup/01, "Standard
# Internal Structure for Every Project Folder") for whenever this needs
# real data-source credentials or connection settings.
